# RIMMSQOL and the shared steps that drive it. The dedicated avec-rimmsqol pass selects
# 17-rimmsqol-shortcut.feature; requirement tags prevent it from being counted in a pass where
# its integration dependencies are absent.
#
# Not something this mod wrote. The steps are PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps, and the demonstration this feature is
# adapted from is FlavorTextExtendedFR's 12-rimmsqol-shortcut.feature. What this mod owes RIMMSQOL is that its
# shortcut is one RIMMSQOL can list and reveal - MOD_SETTINGS.md - and that is all this pass asserts.
#
# The folder PickleTools has to be cloned beside the mods under exactly that name: the path below is relative
# to the collection's root, and the folder's own About.xml packageId must equal the one written here.
MalteSchulze.RIMMSqol            1084452457
nelim.pickletools.rimmsqol       path:PickleTools/RimmsqolSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.interfacescale path:PickleTools/InterfaceScale/Mod
